    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i tried some juice but i still feel really dizzy and my heart is racing. i'm worried if i don't do something more substantial my sugar is gonna crash even harder or just go crazy. i have some extra insulin sitting here, maybe if i just take a tiny bit like 2 units it'll help level me out so i don't have this massive roller coaster effect? it feels safer than just waiting around.",
